329_r113_sankhya_bindu.sm:8:11: Sutram truti [E_PRATYAHRITA]: sankhya_bindu (sankhya_dot) pratyahrita - asyah phalam ashuddham, sanshodhanam pratiksate
      likha(sankhya_bindu(a, a, 2))
            ^
Sanket: dvayoh kosh dasham bindu-gunanaya: yoj sankhyiki, bindu_gunan(a, b) - laghutara dirghata eva pathyate
